{"title":"Silver Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 18)</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 18 <span class=\"muted\">(375 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/silver-bar\">Silver Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"s muted\">No monster drops recorded for this item.</div>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"silver-arms\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"titan\">Titan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"camel\">Camel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"weasel\">Weasel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"leopard\">Leopard</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"sage\">Sage</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"mage\">Mage</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Protection comes from the armor of all five pieces together, up to 75%.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>A full set of it protects</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>0.7 armor · 0.3 magic defense</td><td>19% blows · 8% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>0.8 armor · 0.3 magic defense</td><td>21% blows · 9% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>0.9 armor · 0.4 magic defense</td><td>23% blows · 10% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>1 armor · 0.4 magic defense</td><td>25% blows · 11% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>1.1 armor · 0.4 magic defense</td><td>27% blows · 12% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>1.2 armor · 0.5 magic defense</td><td>29% blows · 13% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>1.3 armor · 0.5 magic defense</td><td>31% blows · 13% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-arms?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>1.4 armor · 0.6 magic defense</td><td>32% blows · 14% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Shoddy ones</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Armor Smithing 18): the higher above 18 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"silver-arms\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>18 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%